@refraction-ui/react-emoji-glyph
================================

This package ships no artwork. By default `EmojiGlyph` loads third-party
artwork at runtime (from jsDelivr, or from the directories you pass as
`animatedBaseUrl` / `twemojiBaseUrl`). Applications that display it must
preserve the attributions below (for example, on an About or Licenses screen).

